#* {{quote-book|en|author=Alexandria Mangas|title=Oxygen for the Swimmer|year=2009|publisher=Xulon Press|page=91|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=OuSI6e1oacMC&pg=PA91&dq=%22swim+meet%22&hl=en&cd=28&source=gbs_api#v=onepage&q=%22swim%20meet%22&f=false|isbn=978-1-60791-603-1|author2=Janet Hommel Mangas|passage=Everyone has to experience their first swim '''meet'''. They have to get through their first race, their first DQ (disqualification), and their first miss/scratch of an event. Like all swimmers, my first swim '''meet''' was nerve-wracking.}}
