#* {{quote-av|en|medium=television production|author={{w|Matthew Weiner}}|title=The Sopranos|episode=Rat Pack|year=2004|season=5|number=2|passage=So what do you wanna do? I wanna be absolutely fucking sure. That's what I wanna do. We arrange a '''meet'''. I'll feel him out a little bit.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2012-02-23|author=Joe Kloc|title=The Case of the Missing Moon Rocks|work=Wired|url=https://www.wired.com/2012/02/opinion-kloc-missing-moon-rocks/|issn=1059-1028|passage=Rosen assured Cregger that he had left no paper trail in bringing the rock into the States. Pretending to be reassured, Cregger agreed to a location for a '''meet''': Tuna’s, a small restaurant and margarita bar off West Dixie highway in North Miami Beach.}}
