===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|mete}}, {{m|enm|imete}}, from {{inh|en|ang|ġemǣte||suitable, having the same measurements}}, from the {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gamētijaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*mētiz||reasonable; estimable}} (cognate with {{cog|nl|meten||measure}}, {{cog|de|gemäß||suitable}} etc.), itself from collective prefix {{m|gem-pro|*ga-}} + {{der|en|ine-pro|*med-||to measure}}.

